\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\exists Y\\in2^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{MLRandom}(Y)\\land Y\\le_T(X\\oplus\\varnothing^{\\prime})\\land\\neg(X\\le_KY)\\land\\neg(Y\\le_KX)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\exists Y\\in2^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{MLRandom}(Y)\\land Y\\le_T(X\\oplus\\varnothing^{\\prime})\\land\\neg(X\\le_KY)\\land\\neg(Y\\le_KX)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>准确的预言机界是X⊕0′；仅用相对低基定理得到的较弱界X′不能替代本结论。来源给出逐步扩张构造；本轮核对陈述与构造所使用的oracle界。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 14.4.23; printed pp.403–404 / PDF pp.423–424。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-complexity-red","status":"resolved","id":"9d68ed64bfec741d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-complexity-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"be1278f108eb178d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"res